request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true. --single

single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/commands.test.ts  (Add a `clear` command. There is no `completed` field on Todo. The field that marks a todo as completed is `done`, which the `complete` command sets to true, so clear removes todos with done === true. Added the Command variant, parseArgs support, a pure clear() function, the run handler (output "Cleared N") and new tests. I only added test cases and changed no existing assertions.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (The oracle passed: tsc ran clean and all 12 vitest tests passed. The clear command is in place and tested.)

